00:19:21.650 --> 00:19:25.330
to make Deadline absolutely
rock solid on Google.

00:19:25.330 --> 00:19:28.015
And we really look forward
to hearing from you

00:19:28.015 --> 00:19:29.890
and, like I said try it
out, there's no cost.

00:19:29.890 --> 00:19:32.550
You can do in a very short
amount of time play with it

00:19:32.550 --> 00:19:33.800
